Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,stuff
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's autumn, Ioryogi! It smells like autumn!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.74,0:00:31.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Smells like autumn?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.03,0:00:33.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.29,0:00:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A little like smoke, and a little like sunshine.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.53,0:00:41.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's a brisk, refreshing feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It makes me feel nostalgic.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.04,0:00:48.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You don't remember anything, but you still know what autumn smells like?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.38,0:00:49.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.79,0:00:50.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.17,0:00:53.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.72,0:01:18.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.35,0:03:00.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen such a wonderful gingko tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.90,0:03:04.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It really is autumn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.82,0:03:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? You don't seem happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.73,0:03:13.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look at this. You know what it is, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.93,0:03:24.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... When it's fall, the leaves all get dressed up pretty and dance in the wind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:27.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Who told you to let your imagination get that overactive?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.38,0:03:30.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato! What do you want!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.95,0:03:33.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.23,0:03:38.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you forgot!?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.84,0:03:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,To go where I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.25,0:03:46.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you need to do to get there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.99,0:03:48.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:50.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Collect candy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.04,0:03:53.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And what do you need to do to collect candy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.62,0:03:56.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Heal people's scarred hearts!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.10,0:03:58.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How long do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.52,0:04:00.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Until the four seasons pass!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.75,0:04:02.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,How many do you have left?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:03.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Two!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.77,0:04:05.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And how much do you have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.63,0:04:06.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.96,0:04:09.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.18,0:04:13.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.15,0:04:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You know where that place is, don't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.16,0:04:23.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.58,0:04:26.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.86,0:04:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, look out! You'll lose your hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.87,0:04:34.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.21,0:04:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,C'mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.95,0:04:42.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.05,0:04:46.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever! I hate you, Toshihiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? You shouldn't tell people you hate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuzuru and Toshihiko are arguing over blocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.74,0:05:00.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,My train needs a triangle, but Toshihiko took them both!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I needed to put them together to make a square!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.34,0:05:07.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Aren't there any squares left?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:15.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why don't we all make something big togther? Maybe a castle?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.09,0:05:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Never mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.72,0:05:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If you don't take care of those, I'm going to take them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.15,0:05:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever, they suck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.45,0:05:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's right! They're dirty used junk you should just throw away!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.98,0:05:56.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't get mad, Mister Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.07,0:06:18.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:22.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.49,0:06:24.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:29.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi? I hear you, but I can't see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.77,0:06:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.52,0:06:32.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.66,0:06:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Quit wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:37.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You think you're gonna get any candy doing that!?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:41.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You're right, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.41,0:06:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.39,0:06:50.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What happened with Fujimoto before he left for work?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.74,0:06:54.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He usually at least says goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.84,0:06:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:58.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.01,0:07:00.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.37,0:07:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.82,0:07:07.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.64,0:07:12.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He didn't look angry, just sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:16.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry I didn't realize.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.10,0:07:19.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.19,0:07:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,He's just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.77,0:07:28.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wish we could get new toys for the kids to cool them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.77,0:07:30.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toys...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.56,0:07:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I know! I know just the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just the place?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.73,0:07:43.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.56,0:07:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Somewhere fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.11,0:07:50.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What a big tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.91,0:07:56.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Today we're all going to collect leaves!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.40,0:08:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,When we're done, we'll bring them back and make pictures with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.84,0:08:01.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pictures?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.04,0:08:05.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They come in all different shapes and colours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.50,0:08:09.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what kind of pictures you'll make?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.42,0:08:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get some!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.73,0:08:15.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, us too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Look, Miss Sayaka! A pretty leaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.74,0:08:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.96,0:08:31.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.05,0:08:33.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Kobato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.47,0:08:38.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.94,0:08:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... About the blocks...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.92,0:08:48.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Will you promise me you'll take good care of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.05,0:08:51.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.81,0:08:52.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.97,0:08:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What do you do after you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.11,0:08:59.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.11,0:09:00.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:03.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You need to apologise to Fujimoto later.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.80,0:09:04.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.44,0:09:07.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll give Mister Kiyokazu plenty of leaves too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.90,0:09:12.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good, they made up.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.23,0:09:17.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They don't normally argue that often.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.54,0:09:21.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It must be because I'm worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.74,0:09:26.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't be! A smile fits you better!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.16,0:09:30.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:33.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I keep frowning, it'll scare happy things away, won't it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.80,0:09:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, smile, smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.87,0:09:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like it's aflame.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.18,0:09:54.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.58,0:10:07.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's so beautiful and tranquil.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.78,0:10:26.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Get back! It's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.81,0:10:32.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.73,0:10:37.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We're chopping that tree down tomorrow. Today, we're putting a fence up around it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That ginkgo tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.89,0:10:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.84,0:10:46.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The locals have been complaining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.95,0:10:49.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They want it out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.18,0:10:52.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No way! It's so splendid and beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.01,0:10:55.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,And because it's so splendid, the leaves go all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.84,0:10:58.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, there's a new urban renewal program.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.76,0:11:03.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Now if you'll excuse us{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.67,0:11:17.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.01,0:11:17.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.52,0:11:20.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's urban renewal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.13,0:11:26.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's when they tear down old towns or buildings and make new ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.56,0:11:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's urban renewal?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:30.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.36,0:11:38.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are old things that unwanted?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like {\i1}that{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.61,0:11:46.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Most people just like new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.17,0:12:20.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's not time to go back to the nursery yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.65,0:12:22.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go ask them!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.99,0:12:23.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.85,0:12:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll ask them not to cut it down!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.89,0:12:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.29,0:12:30.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:34.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,If I ask, they'll{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.58,0:12:51.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.57,0:12:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Kobato and Ioryogi.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku, you're worried about the ginkgo tree too?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.37,0:13:07.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,This urban renewal is terrible for old things!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.65,0:13:09.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.23,0:13:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll ask them, so it'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.84,0:13:14.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.30,0:13:17.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Just what will be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.25,0:13:23.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh, they didn't have this fence up yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.79,0:13:25.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,They're doing urban renewal!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh my. Well, they've been discussing it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.92,0:13:37.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's an impressive tree, but thiss will make it easier for the people who live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.24,0:13:43.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.59,0:13:46.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But renewal is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.87,0:13:51.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, what a big tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.41,0:13:54.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's kind of spooky.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.43,0:13:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.57,0:13:58.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Oh no, look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.31,0:14:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Kobato?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.06,0:14:04.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.19,0:14:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be unhappy everyone else doesn't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.90,0:14:09.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.67,0:14:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.93,0:14:15.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't the tree lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.85,0:14:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Lonely?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.71,0:14:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's been here watching this town grow for decades or even centuries.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.60,0:14:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But no one worries about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.07,0:15:02.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry, Kobato.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.31,0:15:05.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It says it's not lonely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.61,0:15:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You can understand what it's thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.89,0:15:15.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.56,0:15:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Are you just playing dumb? You know Kohaku's an angel.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.39,0:15:23.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Um... Is it thinking anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.97,0:15:31.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It's happy the little ones had so much fun under it yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.51,0:15:40.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Is there anything else I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.55,0:15:46.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It says thanks. And...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.18,0:15:49.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.61,0:15:55.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry! I'll ask them not to cut you down!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.11,0:16:06.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't seem like it wants that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.15,0:16:11.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.07,0:16:13.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.20,0:16:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kobato...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.78,0:16:26.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, don't overdo it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:28.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But... But!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.21,0:16:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But if I don't they're gonna{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.72,0:16:46.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I knew a wisteria that had lived this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.40,0:16:54.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It said the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.35,0:16:56.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The same thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.33,0:17:03.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That it was happiest watching over the people that it loved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:20.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Can you hear its song?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.24,0:17:32.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yes... It's a little sad, but so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.57,0:17:49.47,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,On the shore in the autumn
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.10,0:17:55.97,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,In winter, sleeping in the treetops
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.61,0:18:09.20,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The endless kindness of this world
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.75,0:18:22.12,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As night falls, let us offer our prayers
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.12,0:18:35.65,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,And silently welcome tomorrow's sun
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.01,0:18:50.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,A faraway voice leads me on
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.10,0:18:56.98,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Like it's smiling, like it's singing
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.98,0:19:03.28,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,The echoing sound of the wind
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.28,0:19:09.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Joy and sadness
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.70,0:19:16.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I embrace them both and keep going
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.30,0:19:23.09,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,My hand and yours
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.09,0:19:29.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Join together strongly
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.14,0:19:39.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.15,0:20:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The tree{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.60,0:20:13.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That was dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:15.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What were you doing just standing there!?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.76,0:20:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.26,0:20:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,So that's all it had left...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The core was rotted out. Sooner or later, it would've been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.57,0:20:35.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It tried to hold on just a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.10,0:20:39.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.52,0:20:43.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Was it happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.80,0:20:44.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:46.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.81,0:20:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your singing saw it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.87,0:21:05.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Ioryogi?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.42,0:21:09.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Whose candy could this be?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.52,0:21:12.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Kohaku's?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.23,0:21:13.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.07,0:21:17.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto's!? Nah, no way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.50,0:21:19.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe it's from that ginkgo tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.21,0:21:23.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Wouldn't be too weird if it's what you healed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.52,0:21:31.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,But I wasn't able to save it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:32.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,You sang, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.15,0:21:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,A song?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.52,0:21:36.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,What did Kohaku tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.76,0:21:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Your song sent it off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.47,0:21:43.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,It was happy in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.54,0:21:46.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.82,0:21:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,There! How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.94,0:22:02.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Fujimoto, let's make one!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.63,0:22:05.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.75,0:22:12.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,These are blocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.03,0:22:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm making them out of that ginkgo.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.58,0:22:18.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,The ginkgo?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.86,0:22:24.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,That's wonderful, Fujimoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.88,0:22:25.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:30.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone! Fujimoto's making new blocks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:40.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Toshihiko! Yuzuru! Don't you have something to say to Fujimoto before you play with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.72,0:22:44.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Mister Kiyokazu!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.94,0:22:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.86,0:22:48.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Good, everyone's made up!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.68,0:22:52.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mister Kiyokazu, make a leaf picture with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.37,0:22:53.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not really{\fscx200}-{\fscx81}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.18,0:22:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,We'll stick on ginkgo leaves, and make a ginkgo Fujimoto alien!{:psyduck:}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.59,0:22:57.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.27,0:01:35.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{95 after the first frame of ribbon}What shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:43.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even the obvious things are always so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.45,0:01:53.25,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,I just want to grin when I'm happy, sing when I'm in love
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.76,0:01:59.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,They say my dreams will come true someday
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.05,0:02:06.81,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but when will someday come? I can't wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.81,0:02:12.48,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Count one, two, three and spread my arms
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.48,0:02:17.70,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Gather the light to myself
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.70,0:02:23.99,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Where is it? Tell me what I can do
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.99,0:02:29.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I'm hurt so much, even if I run so hard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.67,0:02:36.38,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Even if I collapse crying over and over, I still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:45.10,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,believe in my amazing future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.90,0:03:00.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,1125)\pos(360,166)\c&HFFFFFF&}... Angel and Guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:08.15,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,{14 into ED}People all want to fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.82,0:23:15.66,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,but they're cheated by gravity
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.25,0:23:23.67,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,everyone can really fly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.26,0:23:32.30,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,She must be so unhappy because
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.64,0:23:43.31,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,she forgot her own shadow somewhere
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.69,0:23:46.03,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.57,0:23:54.45,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,If you tell me "thanks", if you say "thanks" and smile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.45,0:24:01.54,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,Going back and forth, we'll be happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.33,0:24:11.05,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,You'll be happy, there'll be nothing to worry about
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.13,0:24:15.22,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,As long as we're together
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.93,0:24:28.36,Song,,0000,0000,0000,,It's strange, I'm crying even though I'm happy
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.36,0:24:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(458,388)}... Searching at Sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.36,0:24:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(500,0)\pos(456,116)}Next episode
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.24,0:22:59.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,
